Hi Janet,

Thank you for talking through the four-week request with Divya and me this mo=
rning. At the end of four weeks we can review the results and findings from t=
he single-site rehearsal, with separate day and night practice. That checkpoi=
nt would not complete the full cutover or the handoff to regular support. The=
 findings need to be resolved and approved before the two groups move, follow=
ed by stabilization and the support handoff.

Divya's estimate is nine weeks once the initial roster and responsible site c=
ontacts are confirmed. We have not set a start date or cutover dates. I've at=
tached the slides we used today so you have the sequence and the distinction =
between your requested window and the estimate together.

Could you send me the candidates for site contacts and the night rehearsal wi=
ndow by January 23? Divya will prepare the evidence items needed for the deci=
sion after the rehearsal. We can use your inputs to work out the next plannin=
g step without putting dates on the calendar yet.

Thanks,
Michelle

